{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2778610/extras/7b3e66a00c863600f6cf00255045c2c6.poster.avif?t=1772835123\" width=1170 height=330 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2778610/extras/7b3e66a00c863600f6cf00255045c2c6.webm?t=1772835123\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2778610/extras/7b3e66a00c863600f6cf00255045c2c6.mp4?t=1772835123\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A WW1 action game built around fully destructible battlefields where chaos reigns supreme. Explosions tear through terrain, fortifications collapse, and the front line can change shape minute to minute.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Over The Top: WWI\u00a0</strong>turns the grim setting of the Great War into a frantic playground of destruction where plans rarely ever survive first contact.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2778610/extras/062d198a460ef3cd2cdcc71c20a94a9d.poster.avif?t=1772835123\" width=1170 height=328 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2778610/extras/062d198a460ef3cd2cdcc71c20a94a9d.webm?t=1772835123\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2778610/extras/062d198a460ef3cd2cdcc71c20a94a9d.mp4?t=1772835123\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Pick your Role</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Charge as a rifleman, build as an engineer, clear trenches as a pyromaniac flamethrower specialist, or call in airstrikes as an officer. Each class has a clear job on the battlefield, plus plenty of room for improvisation. Choose from three factions: France, Britain, or Germany, each with eight distinct classes. Unlock new equipment and customization as you play.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2778610/extras/e1a7f55d4c29cd63b3d8730428d83bfe.poster.avif?t=1772835123\" width=1170 height=330 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2778610/extras/e1a7f55d4c29cd63b3d8730428d83bfe.webm?t=1772835123\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2778610/extras/e1a7f55d4c29cd63b3d8730428d83bfe.mp4?t=1772835123\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Sandbox of Destruction</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A dynamic, destructive WW1 Sandbox: blow up everything, dig anywhere, reshape trenches, collapse buildings, destroy fortifications. Explosions leave permanent changes that affect sightlines, routes, and cover. Fight across multiple maps, playable in different seasons and daytimes. Use the full map editor to create and share your own battlegrounds.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2778610/extras/8fdbdee88da0fcc12d101a89c17bb0ef.poster.avif?t=1772835123\" width=1170 height=328 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2778610/extras/8fdbdee88da0fcc12d101a89c17bb0ef.webm?t=1772835123\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2778610/extras/8fdbdee88da0fcc12d101a89c17bb0ef.mp4?t=1772835123\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>200-Player Mayhem</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Dive into massive 200-player battles! Drop into the middle of an epic war movie, packed with flying debris, collapsing trenches, charging tanks and objectives changing hands as the ground itself gets carved up - pure multiplayer madness awaits you.\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2778610/extras/6ec4a5070776e86aa291e726b435c242.poster.avif?t=1772835123\" width=1170 height=328 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2778610/extras/6ec4a5070776e86aa291e726b435c242.webm?t=1772835123\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2778610/extras/6ec4a5070776e86aa291e726b435c242.mp4?t=1772835123\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>A Rich, Bombastic Arsenal</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Bring flamethrowers, poison gas, shovels, dynamite, artillery, airplanes, machine guns, and a lineup of vehicles and experimental tanks. Gear up with a mix of historical weapons, use a vast lineup of different vehicles, and other items: slap enemies with a baguette or play the bagpipe to boost morale!  Have you ever driven a tank with 10 other players inside? In our game, you can do so!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2778610/extras/ffc5c0651137bf96880967184885f645.avif?t=1772835123\" width=1560 height=1368 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>","achievements":{"highlighted":[{"name":"Engineer","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2778610/c1ea9dcd9822954328548699a861baf651fc502c.jpg"},{"name":"Create a Map","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2778610/5fd7b4a22f98f257dd30e122952780fa8ccdb296.jpg"},{"name":"Play Instrument","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2778610/20abdf1a25275e7f1a181634d712baf13e3eac06.jpg"},{"name":"Bandage","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2778610/0634be14687c2325b98dbe727f5d0d49ed8a4835.jpg"},{"name":"Look Out!","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2778610/d2c3cf28541cd99ccd577cacbafc0587f1f8433f.jpg"},{"name":"Lazy git","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2778610/44c23a5e96d3682b199378fabe4a555acdd72d23.jpg"},{"name":"Roleplaying","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2778610/bf1ccba578b56aab9e182d003e5658f658a818c1.jpg"},{"name":"They couldn\u2019t hit an elephant at this distance","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2778610/df027f5c924a29a8ac5ac18177bcac5f2e8161f7.jpg"},{"name":"Long and Big","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2778610/faddfe44d7b3d9278c24be31b9e939926c26d63c.jpg"},{"name":"Beat 'em up","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2778610/0c3e5567f8a31a5bd6dd62417d166006985cf92c.jpg"}],"total":32},"background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/2778610?t=1772835123","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2778610/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1772835123","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2778610/60cf9215fd65988992744c1d7b2fa651b825ddbb/capsule_231x87_alt_assets_0.jpg?t=1772835123","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2778610/60cf9215fd65988992744c1d7b2fa651b825ddbb/capsule_184x69_alt_assets_0.jpg?t=1772835123","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Multi-player","id":1},{"description":"PvP","id":49},{"description":"Online PvP","id":36},{"description":"LAN PvP","id":47},{"description":"Co-op","id":9},{"description":"Online Co-op","id":38},{"description":"LAN Co-op","id":48},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Steam Workshop","id":30},{"description":"Camera Comfort","id":67},{"description":"Color Alternatives","id":66},{"description":"Custom Volume Controls","id":68},{"description":"Keyboard Only Option","id":75},{"description":"Playable without Timed Input","id":74},{"description":"Stereo Sound","id":69},{"description":"Subtitle Options","id":65},{"description":"Partial Controller Support","id":18},{"description":"Steam Cloud","id":23},{"description":"Includes level editor","id":17},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[2,5],"notes":"This game features mature content, including blood, gore, and depictions of death. "},"detailed_description":"<h1>Roadmap</h1><p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2778610/extras/d2e09523ff4d13cca29924d8e7546332.avif?t=1772835123\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2778610/extras_big/d2e09523ff4d13cca29924d8e7546332.avif?t=1772835123 width=1560 height=660 /></span></p></p><br><h1>About the Game</h1><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2778610/extras/7b3e66a00c863600f6cf00255045c2c6.poster.avif?t=1772835123\" width=1170 height=330 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2778610/extras/7b3e66a00c863600f6cf00255045c2c6.webm?t=1772835123\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2778610/extras/7b3e66a00c863600f6cf00255045c2c6.mp4?t=1772835123\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A WW1 action game built around fully destructible battlefields where chaos reigns supreme. Explosions tear through terrain, fortifications collapse, and the front line can change shape minute to minute.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Over The Top: WWI\u00a0</strong>turns the grim setting of the Great War into a frantic playground of destruction where plans rarely ever survive first contact.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2778610/extras/062d198a460ef3cd2cdcc71c20a94a9d.poster.avif?t=1772835123\" width=1170 height=328 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2778610/extras/062d198a460ef3cd2cdcc71c20a94a9d.webm?t=1772835123\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2778610/extras/062d198a460ef3cd2cdcc71c20a94a9d.mp4?t=1772835123\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Pick your Role</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Charge as a rifleman, build as an engineer, clear trenches as a pyromaniac flamethrower specialist, or call in airstrikes as an officer. Each class has a clear job on the battlefield, plus plenty of room for improvisation. Choose from three factions: France, Britain, or Germany, each with eight distinct classes. Unlock new equipment and customization as you play.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2778610/extras/e1a7f55d4c29cd63b3d8730428d83bfe.poster.avif?t=1772835123\" width=1170 height=330 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2778610/extras/e1a7f55d4c29cd63b3d8730428d83bfe.webm?t=1772835123\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2778610/extras/e1a7f55d4c29cd63b3d8730428d83bfe.mp4?t=1772835123\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Sandbox of Destruction</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A dynamic, destructive WW1 Sandbox: blow up everything, dig anywhere, reshape trenches, collapse buildings, destroy fortifications. Explosions leave permanent changes that affect sightlines, routes, and cover. Fight across multiple maps, playable in different seasons and daytimes. Use the full map editor to create and share your own battlegrounds.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2778610/extras/8fdbdee88da0fcc12d101a89c17bb0ef.poster.avif?t=1772835123\" width=1170 height=328 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2778610/extras/8fdbdee88da0fcc12d101a89c17bb0ef.webm?t=1772835123\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2778610/extras/8fdbdee88da0fcc12d101a89c17bb0ef.mp4?t=1772835123\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>200-Player Mayhem</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Dive into massive 200-player battles! Drop into the middle of an epic war movie, packed with flying debris, collapsing trenches, charging tanks and objectives changing hands as the ground itself gets carved up - pure multiplayer madness awaits you.\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2778610/extras/6ec4a5070776e86aa291e726b435c242.poster.avif?t=1772835123\" width=1170 height=328 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2778610/extras/6ec4a5070776e86aa291e726b435c242.webm?t=1772835123\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2778610/extras/6ec4a5070776e86aa291e726b435c242.mp4?t=1772835123\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>A Rich, Bombastic Arsenal</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Bring flamethrowers, poison gas, shovels, dynamite, artillery, airplanes, machine guns, and a lineup of vehicles and experimental tanks. Gear up with a mix of historical weapons, use a vast lineup of different vehicles, and other items: slap enemies with a baguette or play the bagpipe to boost morale!  Have you ever driven a tank with 10 other players inside? In our game, you can do so!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2778610/extras/ffc5c0651137bf96880967184885f645.avif?t=1772835123\" width=1560 height=1368 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>","developers":["Flying Squirrel Entertainment"],"dlc":[4309530,4308300],"genres":[{"description":"Action","id":"1"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"},{"description":"Massively Multiplayer","id":"29"},{"description":"Simulation","id":"28"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2778610/06019e08c5e52abbfd39bddcfaef1202770b8b96/header_alt_assets_0.jpg?t=1772835123","is_free":false,"legal_notice":"Over The Top - WW1 \u00a92026 Developed by Flying Squirrel Entertainment, published by GG Pub